<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-HEARST-ARGYLE STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-HEARST-ARGYLE STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co analyst Frank Bodenchak started coverage of Hearst-Argyle Television Inc with an outperform rating on Wednesday, the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- San Antonio, Texas company Argyle Television Inc will merge with Hearst Corp's television broadcast group on August 29, forming Hearst-Argyle. The shares are to begin trading then under the symbol  HATV.O.</p>
<p>-- Argyle operates six television network affilates.</p>
<p>-- Argyle shares were up 1/2 to 27 in early trading.</p>
</text>
